---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Joe Sheldon | Redfin Senior Agent"
description: "Greater Seattle real estate insights, hyper-local market stats, and buyer & seller guides with Redfin Senior Agent Joe Sheldon."
permalink: /index.html
---
<div class="canvas-universal-white pb-24">
    
    <!-- Profile Bento -->
    <section class="bento-squircle bg-surface-gray elevation-soft mx-4 mt-6 p-6 text-center border-light">
        <img src="https://assets.myseattlesearch.com/repomove/joe.webp" alt="Joe Sheldon - Seattle Real Estate Agent" class="avatar-squircle mx-auto mb-4" width="120" height="120" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
        <h1 class="text-premier-charcoal text-xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-1">Joe Sheldon</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary-muted text-sm">Redfin Senior Agent</p>
        <p class="text-secondary-muted text-sm mb-6">Serving North King & South Snohomish Counties, Washington</p>
         
        <div class="grid-3-col border-t border-light pt-6 mb-6">
            <div class="stat-block">
                <span class="tabular-nums text-premier-charcoal text-lg font-medium block">{{ personalStats['Closed Sales'] }}</span>
                <span class="overline-label text-secondary-muted block mt-1">Transactions</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-block">
                <span class="tabular-nums text-premier-charcoal text-lg font-medium block">${{ (personalStats['Total Sales Volume'] / 1000000) | round(0, "floor") }}M</span>
                <span class="overline-label text-secondary-muted block mt-1">Volume</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-block">
                <span class="tabular-nums text-status-amber text-lg font-medium block">{{ personalStats['Average Rating'] }}</span>
                <span class="overline-label text-secondary-muted block mt-1">Rating</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-column gap-3">
            <a href="/contact.vcf" class="pill-btn btn-surface text-premier-charcoal w-full">Save My Contact Info</a>
            <a href="https://www.redfin.com/real-estate-agents/joe-sheldon?loyalty=true" class="pill-btn bg-alpine-blue text-universal-white w-full" target="_blank">View My Redfin Profile</a>
            <a href="/sales/" class="pill-btn btn-surface text-premier-charcoal w-full">Listings & Sales</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Education Promo Bento -->
    <section class="bento-squircle bg-universal-white elevation-soft mx-4 mt-4 p-6 text-center border-light">
        <h2 class="text-premier-charcoal text-lg font-medium mb-2">Free Home Buying Classes</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary-muted text-sm mb-5 leading-relaxed">Join us to learn everything you need to know about navigating the current real estate market.</p>
        <a href="/events/" class="pill-btn bg-alpine-blue text-universal-white w-full">View Upcoming Classes & Register</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Media Bento -->
    <section class="bento-squircle bg-universal-white elevation-soft mx-4 mt-4 p-6 border-light">
        <!-- Note: Handwriting font is now handled by the global CSS class .font-signature -->
        <h2 class="font-signature text-alpine-blue text-center text-2xl mb-5">Won't you be my neighbor?</h2>
        <div class="media-frame squircle-inner overflow-hidden">
            <youtube-lite 
                video-id="e3o5FIXoK84" 
                poster="https://assets.myseattlesearch.com/repomove/youtubeneighborthumbnail.webp" 
                label="Won't you be my neighbor video">
            </youtube-lite>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Testimonials Bento -->
    <section class="bento-squircle bg-universal-white elevation-soft mx-4 mt-4 p-6 border-light">
        <h2 class="text-premier-charcoal text-lg font-medium mb-5 text-center">Client Reviews</h2>
        
        <div class="flex-column gap-5">
            {% for review in homepageReviews %}
            <div class="review-tile border-b border-light pb-5 last:border-0 last:pb-0">
                <div class="text-status-amber text-sm mb-2 tabular-nums">★★★★★</div>
                <p class="text-premier-charcoal text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">"{{ review['Full Review'] }}"</p>
                <div class="overline-label text-secondary-muted">— {{ review.Reviewer }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Biography Bento -->
    <section class="bento-squircle bg-universal-white elevation-soft mx-4 mt-4 mb-8 p-6 border-light">
        <h2 class="text-premier-charcoal text-lg font-medium mb-4">About Me</h2>
        <p class="text-premier-charcoal text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            I transplanted to Seattle in 2009, and the Pacific Northwest has become my new home. I am in love with its natural beauty and the abundance of year-round activities. Having grew up around the construction business, I developed a deep understanding of what makes a good home.
        </p>
        <p class="text-premier-charcoal text-sm leading-relaxed">
            My real estate passion comes from my desire to help you navigate the journey of purchasing one of the largest yet most personal items of your lifetime. I joined Redfin in 2014 to pursue this passion relentlessly. I like my customers to think of me as their coach throughout the entire process. My team and I will give you expert guidance at every turn, and I'll be by your side through the ups and downs. You can expect me to provide honest advice and tireless advocacy.
        </p>
    </section>

</div>